<view class="page">
  <view class="card center"><image class="profile-avatar" src="/assets/shiji-ai-avatar.png"/><view class="card-title">我的饮食档案</view><view class="muted">信息仅用于目标计算、饮食记录和个性化提醒。</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{message}}" class="{{success ? 'success' : 'error'}}">{{message}}</view>
  <view class="card"><view class="eyebrow">基础信息</view><view class="form-grid" style="margin-top:18rpx"><view><text class="label">年龄</text><input class="input" type="number" value="{{form.age}}" placeholder="21" bindinput="onField" data-field="age"/></view><view><text class="label">身高 cm</text><input class="input" type="digit" value="{{form.height_cm}}" placeholder="165" bindinput="onField" data-field="height_cm"/></view><view><text class="label">体重 kg</text><input class="input" type="digit" value="{{form.current_weight_kg}}" placeholder="55" bindinput="onField" data-field="current_weight_kg"/></view><view><text class="label">每周运动</text><input class="input" value="{{form.exercise_habits}}" placeholder="网球2-3次" bindinput="onField" data-field="exercise_habits"/></view></view><text class="label">性别</text><picker mode="selector" range="{{sexes}}" bindchange="onSex"><view class="input">{{sexes[sexIndex]}}</view></picker><text class="label">活动水平</text><picker mode="selector" range="{{activities}}" bindchange="onActivity"><view class="input">{{activities[activityIndex]}}</view></picker><text class="label">主要目标</text><picker mode="selector" range="{{goals}}" bindchange="onGoal"><view class="input">{{goals[goalIndex]}}</view></picker><button class="button" loading="{{saving}}" bindtap="saveProfile">保存并计算目标</button></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="list-item" bindtap="exportData"><view class="list-main">复制我的数据<text class="list-sub">复制饮食、运动和档案数据，便于保存</text></view><text>›</text></view><view class="list-item" bindtap="openPrivacy"><view class="list-main">用户协议与隐私说明<text class="list-sub">查看信息收集、AI 服务和数据权利</text></view><text>›</text></view><view class="list-item" bindtap="deleteData"><view class="list-main" style="color:#a44934">删除账户数据</view><text style="color:#a44934">›</text></view></view>
  <view class="disclaimer">本结果仅供日常饮食健康参考，不构成医疗诊断或治疗建议。\n如出现持续或严重不适，请及时咨询医生或注册营养师。</view>
</view>
